{
  "audioFile": "trend_vault_voice_1778967514118.mp3",
  "audioDurationSec": 111.124898,
  "source": "word-proportional",
  "captions": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "SCORPIO DOESN'T GO COLD. THEY GO QUIET — AND THAT'S WORSE.",
      "type": "hook",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 4.6734248199233726,
      "duration": 4.6734248199233726,
      "wordCount": 11,
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 4673.4248199233725
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "THEY CAN LAUGH WITH YOU, ANSWER YOUR TEXTS, AND STILL BE QUIETLY DECIDING IF THEY TRUST YOU ANYMORE.",
      "type": "observation",
      "start": 4.6734248199233726,
      "end": 12.337210888888889,
      "duration": 7.663786068965516,
      "wordCount": 18,
      "startMs": 4673.4248199233725,
      "endMs": 12337.210888888889
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "FROM THE OUTSIDE IT LOOKS LIKE INDIFFERENCE. FROM THE INSIDE IT SOUNDS LIKE A COUNTDOWN.",
      "type": "observation",
      "start": 12.337210888888889,
      "end": 18.723699279693484,
      "duration": 6.386488390804596,
      "wordCount": 15,
      "startMs": 12337.210888888889,
      "endMs": 18723.699279693483
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "SCORPIO READS EVERY ROOM BEFORE THEY SPEAK. PEOPLE MISTAKE THAT FOR ARROGANCE. IT'S NEITHER.",
      "type": "observation",
      "start": 18.723699279693484,
      "end": 24.684421777777775,
      "duration": 5.960722498084291,
      "wordCount": 14,
      "startMs": 18723.699279693483,
      "endMs": 24684.421777777774
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "BEHIND EVERY \"I'M FINE\" FROM SCORPIO IS A SENTENCE THEY ALREADY DECIDED YOU WEREN'T READY TO HEAR.",
      "type": "escalation",
      "start": 24.684421777777775,
      "end": 31.922441954022986,
      "duration": 7.238020176245211,
      "wordCount": 17,
      "startMs": 24684.421777777774,
      "endMs": 31922.441954022986
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "THEY NOTICED. THEY'RE JUST NOT TELLING YOU YET.",
      "type": "escalation",
      "start": 31.922441954022986,
      "end": 35.32856909578544,
      "duration": 3.406127141762454,
      "wordCount": 8,
      "startMs": 31922.441954022986,
      "endMs": 35328.56909578544
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "SCORPIO DOESN'T LEAVE DURING THE STORM. THEY LEAVE AFTER — QUIETLY, WITHOUT A SCENE, WITH EVERYTHING ALREADY DECIDED.",
      "type": "escalation",
      "start": 35.32856909578544,
      "end": 42.992355164750954,
      "duration": 7.663786068965514,
      "wordCount": 18,
      "startMs": 35328.56909578544,
      "endMs": 42992.35516475095
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "THE WALL ISN'T THERE TO KEEP YOU OUT. IT'S THERE BECAUSE LAST TIME, NOBODY STOPPED THEM FROM GIVING EVERYTHING.",
      "type": "truth",
      "start": 42.992355164750954,
      "end": 51.08190712643678,
      "duration": 8.089551961685828,
      "wordCount": 19,
      "startMs": 42992.35516475095,
      "endMs": 51081.90712643678
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "THE PART OF THEM YOU GOT WAS EARNED, NOT GIVEN. NOBODY TOLD YOU WHICH.",
      "type": "truth",
      "start": 51.08190712643678,
      "end": 57.042629624521076,
      "duration": 5.960722498084294,
      "wordCount": 14,
      "startMs": 51081.90712643678,
      "endMs": 57042.629624521076
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "IT ISN'T TRUST THEY'RE PROTECTING. IT'S THE VERSION OF THEMSELVES THAT STILL BELIEVES IN IT.",
      "type": "truth",
      "start": 57.042629624521076,
      "end": 63.42911801532568,
      "duration": 6.386488390804601,
      "wordCount": 15,
      "startMs": 57042.629624521076,
      "endMs": 63429.11801532568
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "THEY ARE NOT PULLING AWAY BECAUSE THEY STOPPED CARING. THEY'RE PULLING AWAY BECAUSE STAYING STARTED TO FEEL LIKE BETRAYING THEMSELVES.",
      "type": "truth",
      "start": 63.42911801532568,
      "end": 71.9444358697318,
      "duration": 8.515317854406128,
      "wordCount": 20,
      "startMs": 63429.11801532568,
      "endMs": 71944.43586973181
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "AND WHEN SCORPIO FINALLY GOES QUIET, THAT SILENCE USUALLY MEANS THE DECISION HAS ALREADY BEEN MADE.",
      "type": "twist",
      "start": 71.9444358697318,
      "end": 78.75669015325671,
      "duration": 6.812254283524908,
      "wordCount": 16,
      "startMs": 71944.43586973181,
      "endMs": 78756.69015325671
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "MOST PEOPLE SEE THE SURFACE. THE SILENCE. THE DISTANCE. THE WAY THEY SEEM UNMOVED WHEN EVERYTHING IS MOVING INSIDE THEM.",
      "type": "twist",
      "start": 78.75669015325671,
      "end": 87.27200800766285,
      "duration": 8.515317854406135,
      "wordCount": 20,
      "startMs": 78756.69015325671,
      "endMs": 87272.00800766285
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "IT'S NOT THAT THEY DON'T FEEL IT. IT'S THAT THEY FELT IT FIRST — AND ALONE.",
      "type": "twist",
      "start": 87.27200800766285,
      "end": 94.08426229118776,
      "duration": 6.812254283524908,
      "wordCount": 16,
      "startMs": 87272.00800766285,
      "endMs": 94084.26229118776
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "WHEN SCORPIO SOFTENS AROUND YOU, YOU'RE NOT WINNING THEM. YOU'RE BEING TRUSTED.",
      "type": "ending",
      "start": 94.08426229118776,
      "end": 99.19345300383144,
      "duration": 5.109190712643681,
      "wordCount": 12,
      "startMs": 94084.26229118776,
      "endMs": 99193.45300383144
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "BUT THE REALITY IS FAR MORE COMPLICATED THAN THAT.",
      "type": "ending",
      "start": 99.19345300383144,
      "end": 103.0253460383142,
      "duration": 3.8318930344827606,
      "wordCount": 9,
      "startMs": 99193.45300383144,
      "endMs": 103025.3460383142
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "AND WHEN SCORPIO FINALLY LOWERS THAT WALL — EVEN SLIGHTLY — TREAT IT LIKE THE RARE THING IT IS.",
      "type": "ending",
      "start": 103.0253460383142,
      "end": 111.114898,
      "duration": 8.0895519616858,
      "wordCount": 19,
      "startMs": 103025.3460383142,
      "endMs": 111114.898
    }
  ]
}